## 1. What was built

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `rtl/aether_uf_helios_n_lattice.sv` | Physical lattice: N_PHYS PEs × N_CTX context bank `{cluster_active, cid}` (1 write port), per-slot N_CTX-deep growth bank, FF `touched`/`solid` masks (1-cycle clear) |
| `rtl/aether_uf_helios_n_grow.sv` | FSM + central ordered union-by-size merge (virtual SoA, software tie rule) + writeback to the lattice |
| `rtl/tb_aether_uf_helios_n_decode.sv` | grow → `aether_uf_peel`; checks iters, solid bits, correction, peel_ops per case |
| `src/bin/gen_helios_n_rtl_vectors.rs` | Compiles DEM + M70 coloring → slot / writeback tables; **gates every case** with `assert_helios_n_matches_flat` and `assert_helios_n_decode_matches_cosim` before emitting `rtl/gen/helios_n_cases.sv` |
| `scripts/helios_n_rtl_m74_sim.sh` | cargo test + Stim phenom d=3 r=3 (seed=1, 24 shots → 16 nontrivial) + Verilator (TB 16×16, exercises table remap); `HN_ICARUS=1` adds Icarus at the M70 config (~30 min) |
| `fpga/scale/run_yosys_helios_n_lattice_m74.sh` | Lattice-only Yosys `synth_xilinx -family xcup` → `results/fpga_helios_n_lattice_m74.csv` |

Table layout: slot row `k*SLOTS+s` holds `{edge, (pu,cu), (pv,cv), cap}` for part k; writeback row `k*N_PHYS+p` holds the virtual node that context k of PE p represents. The TB remaps generator rows (`HN_SLOTS`, `HN_NPHYS`) onto DUT parameters (`SLOTS`, `N_PHYS`).

## 2. Schedule (one growth iteration)

`WB` (n_parts clocks: context k of every PE ← `{fact, froot}`) → `CHECK` (1: done if no active root) → `GROW` (n_parts clocks: part k on the lattice; per slot `delta = act_u&!same + act_v&!same`, solidify when `growth+delta >= cap`) → `MERGE` (1: ordered unions of newly solid edges, then `froot`/`fact`).

**clk per iteration = 2·n_parts + 2 = 34** for the M70 map; total = 34·iters + 18 (INIT + first WB + final CHECK). Measured: `total_clk=3425380` over 16 cases; iters identical to flat `growth_cycles` (M71).

